maniT OOP Demo
==============

--- 1. Point struct with impl methods ---
  p1 + p2 = (4, 6)
  p1 * 2 = (6, 8)
  origin  = (0, 0)

--- 2. Counter with chained method calls ---
  After 3 ticks (step=3): 9
  After reset: 0

--- 3. Traits: Describable + Scalable ---
  Rectangle(4x3)
  area = 12
  perimeter = 14
  scaled: Rectangle(8x6)
  magnitude = 48
  Circle(r=5)
  scaled: Circle(r=15)
  magnitude = 225

--- 4. Generic and utility functions ---
  identity(42) = 42
  max(7, 3)  = 7
  clamp(15, 0, 10) = 10

--- 5. Enum with impl methods ---
  North -> opposite -> South
  East -> opposite -> West

All demos complete.
